  "referenceNumber": "RUS0775",
  "remarks": "\nDmitry Alexandrovich PUMPYANSKY (hereafter PUMPYANSKY ) is an involved person under the Russia (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2019 on the basis of the following ground: (1) PUMPYANSKY has been involved in obtaining a benefit from or supporting the Government of Russia by formerly owning or controlling directly or indirectly and working as a director or equivalent for OAO TMK, an entity which is carrying on business in a sector of strategic significance to the Government of Russia, namely the Russian energy sector.  \n",
